---
const steps = [
  {
    number: '01',
    title: 'Tell us what matters',
    copy: 'Share what brought you in, what makes visits difficult, and how much detail you want.',
  },
  {
    number: '02',
    title: 'Set your pace',
    copy: 'Choose a pause signal. Ask for quiet, explanations, or breaks—your preferences lead.',
  },
  {
    number: '03',
    title: 'See what we see',
    copy: 'We review findings together using plain language and only the images that help.',
  },
  {
    number: '04',
    title: 'Leave with a plan',
    copy: 'You get written priorities and next steps. Nothing moves ahead without your say-so.',
  },
];
---

<section class="first-visit section-shell" id="first-visit" aria-labelledby="first-visit-title">
  <div class="first-visit-heading">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">Your first visit</p>
      <h2 id="first-visit-title">No guessing.<br />Here’s what happens.</h2>
    </div>
    <p>
      It is okay to feel nervous. We build time into a first appointment to
      listen, answer questions, and agree on a pace before any exam begins.
    </p>
  </div>
  <ol class="steps-list">
    {steps.map((step) => (
      <li>
        <span class="step-number">{step.number}</span>
        <div>
          <h3>{step.title}</h3>
          <p>{step.copy}</p>
        </div>
      </li>
    ))}
  </ol>
</section>
